hed environments, and a polished Full Body Movement system.\n2. New Levels and a New Mechanics\n\nYour feedback is encouraged, and we are dedicated to keeping you informed about the ongoing development of the 'CTMR' adventure.", "short_description": "Recover your past by completing the Puzzle. The pieces are scattered in different worlds. Walk through the door, face new worlds, and bring back the pieces, Do not succumb to the urge to fight back - doing so loses the piece which is hidden in the world\u201d."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ohilogames.com/privacypolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ohilo Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ohilogames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28440200398959182"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75658019_731844015525589_8515567066952918489_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sgOK1v_O1TcQ7kNvwFtjI6t&_nc_oc=AdlRvij8lRwWm8uoE8ezeW2tk3m_uMkXvgv3TGSyHMKkq_SkYjMCUG0MXA6cifdbasU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxUntoWLGLhXhEwNUcKG4YuDbEFxbc9P3P686VV0NzAlw&oe=69BBF1DE"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_n